# JWT signing keypair, generated on first boot -- by the app and by its tests, which
# boot a real context. The private key must never be committed: anyone holding it can
# mint a token for any user.
#
# Note: there is deliberately no src/test/resources/application.yml overriding the
# key directory. A test yml with the same name SHADOWS src/main/resources/application.yml
# instead of merging with it, so every app.* setting silently disappears -- which
# surfaced as "Could not resolve placeholder 'app.security.issuer'". Override per test
# class if a test ever needs to.
keys/
